Unique Traits: Emotional magic appears to her as subtle pressure, temperature, and color-like impressions rather than spoken information. During werebeast transformations she is unusually good at distinguishing fear, excitement, pain, and ordinary instinctive intensity without treating any of them as automatic danger.;

Education: Core academics, Magical Theory, psychology and ethics electives, Transformation Studies support seminars, and introductory healing practice.;
Training: Grounding, consent protocols, crowd shielding, crisis communication, breathing coaching, emotional-boundary exercises, and supervised Beastcraft Basics support work.;
