Favorite Things: Rainy afternoons, mint tea, quiet group conversations, chamber music, warm lamps, and seeing someone master a skill they were afraid of.;
Pet Peeves: People saying they can 'just tell' what someone feels, unsolicited touching during distress, gossip presented as concern, and students treating empathy as mind reading.;

